# Keep the Docker build context small (ADV-INFRA-002).
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` ships target/ — multiple gigabytes after any local
# build — to Fly's remote builder. The first deploy attempt did exactly that
# and appeared to hang for over an hour while uploading it.
target/
.git/
.github/
docs/
node_modules/
.totem/
*.log

# Keep: Cargo manifests, crates/, and the workspace lockfile — the build
# needs those.

# The downloaded BGE model cache (128MB) — the deployed image fetches its own
# when ADV-STORE-008 enables the fastembed feature; it must not ride along in
# every build context.
**/.fastembed_cache/
arrive-linux
